%%% note
scatter-gather: 結果の形 ({"0": Message, ...} のキー)、各ルートの payload の型、ルートで
書いた変数の合流 (同名変数の上書き順)、1 ルートの失敗で MULE:COMPOSITE_ROUTING になり
error.errorMessage.payload に results / failures が入ること、その description、ハンドラ
無しのときの既定のエラー応答、ルート内の try で失敗を吸収する場合。
%%% port 18113
%%% request POST /basic
Content-Type: application/json

{"x": 1}
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "keys": [
    "0",
    "1",
    "2"
  ],
  "payloads": [
    {
      "route": 0,
      "in": {
        "x": 1
      }
    },
    "route-one",
    {
      "x": 1
    }
  ],
  "vars": {
    "before": "changed-in-route2",
    "fromRoute1": "r1",
    "fromRoute2": [
      1,
      2
    ]
  }
}
%%% request GET /fail
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "errorType": "MULE:COMPOSITE_ROUTING",
  "description": "Error(s) were found for route(s):\n\tRoute 1: org.mule.runtime.api.exception.DefaultMuleException: route 1 failed on purpose\n\tRoute 2: org.mule.runtime.core.api.expression.ExpressionRuntimeException: \"Division by zero\n\n1| 1 / 0\n   ^^^^^\nTrace:\n  at anonymous::main (line: 1, column: 1)\" evaluating expression: \"1 / 0\".",
  "successKeys": [
    "0"
  ],
  "failureKeys": [
    "1",
    "2"
  ],
  "results": {
    "0": "ok-0"
  },
  "failures": {
    "1": {
      "errorType": "APP:ROUTE_FAILED",
      "description": "route 1 failed on purpose"
    },
    "2": {
      "errorType": "MULE:EXPRESSION",
      "description": "\"Division by zero\n\n1| 1 / 0\n   ^^^^^\nTrace:\n  at anonymous::main (line: 1, column: 1)\" evaluating expression: \"1 / 0\"."
    }
  }
}
%%% request GET /fail-unhandled
%%% response 500
content-type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

Error(s) were found for route(s):
	Route 1: org.mule.runtime.api.exception.DefaultMuleException: boom
%%% request GET /route-try
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

[
  "recovered: soft failure",
  "fine"
]
